{"title":"Career Roadmap · CAD/PLM Specialist","role":"CAD/PLM Specialist","summary":"A CAD/PLM Specialist manages and optimizes the digital engineering environment used to design, document, configure, release, revise and manage products throughout their lifecycle.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Design Engineering / Engineering Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A CAD/PLM Specialist manages and optimizes the digital engineering environment used to design, document, configure, release, revise and manage products throughout their lifecycle."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Engineering Design","CAD","Product Data Management","PLM","Engineering Change Management","Configuration Management","Digital Thread"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A CAD/PLM Specialist may work with mechanical, automotive, aerospace, industrial, electronics, medical-device, consumer-product or manufacturing organizations."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong profile combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D CAD"},{"text":"Engineering drawing"},{"text":"GD&T"},{"text":"Product data management"},{"text":"PLM"},{"text":"PDM"},{"text":"BOM management"},{"text":"Configuration management"},{"text":"Engineering change control"},{"text":"CAD data migration"},{"text":"CAD automation"},{"text":"ERP integration"},{"text":"Digital thread"},{"text":"Manufacturing collaboration"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech/B.E. Design Engineering"},{"text":"CAD, engineering design, GD&T, product data, PLM fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"CAD/PLM Specialist / CAD Engineer"},{"text":"CAD administration, PDM/PLM workflows, BOMs, revisions and engineering changes"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior CAD/PLM Specialist / PLM Consultant"},{"text":"PLM architecture, integrations, automation, data governance and digital thread"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"PLM Architect / Digital Engineering Lead"},{"text":"Enterprise PLM strategy, digital thread, lifecycle transformation and engineering systems leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Tech/B.E.","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Engineering Design Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong engineering fundamentals before specializing in software."},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering Mathematics"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Calculus"},{"text":"Linear algebra"},{"text":"Differential equations"},{"text":"Numerical methods"},{"text":"Probability and statistics"},{"text":"Optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the program, develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mechanics"},{"text":"Materials science"},{"text":"Manufacturing processes"},{"text":"Machine elements"},{"text":"Electrical/electronics fundamentals"},{"text":"Engineering physics"},{"text":"Engineering graphics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The CAD/PLM specialist must understand what engineering data means, not simply operate CAD software."},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering Graphics"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Orthographic projection"},{"text":"Isometric views"},{"text":"Sectional views"},{"text":"Auxiliary views"},{"text":"Dimensioning"},{"text":"Tolerances"},{"text":"Surface finish"},{"text":"Fits"},{"text":"Assemblies"},{"text":"Exploded views"},{"text":"Engineering documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to interpret engineering drawings before focusing heavily on 3D modelling."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1–2 — CAD Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong 2D and 3D CAD skills."},{"type":