ness"},{"text":"Hardness"},{"text":"Fatigue"},{"text":"Corrosion"},{"text":"Thermal properties"},{"text":"Manufacturing compatibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3 — Product Data Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Now transition from CAD files to engineering information management."},{"type":"h","text":"PDM"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Data Management"},{"type":"p","text":"PDM controls:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAD files"},{"text":"Drawings"},{"text":"Documents"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Revisions"},{"text":"Approvals"},{"text":"Access"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Engineering records"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical structure:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product","Assembly","Subassembly","Part","CAD Model","Drawing","Specification","Revision"]},{"type":"h","text":"PLM Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"PLM means:"},{"type":"h","text":"Product Lifecycle Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the complete lifecycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Idea","Requirements","Concept","Design","CAD","Prototype","Testing","Manufacturing","Production","Service","Change","End-of-Life"]},{"type":"p","text":"PLM connects engineering with the rest of the organization."},{"type":"h","text":"CAD vs PDM vs PLM"},{"type":"table","header":["Technology","Main Purpose"],"rows":[[{"text":"CAD"},{"text":"Create engineering designs"}],[{"text":"PDM"},{"text":"Manage engineering files and product data"}],[{"text":"PLM"},{"text":"Manage the complete product lifecycle"}],[{"text":"ERP"},{"text":"Manage business/manufacturing/financial operations"}],[{"text":"MES"},{"text":"Manage manufacturing execution"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Understanding these boundaries is essential for a PLM professional."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — PLM Platforms"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain hands-on exposure to one major PLM ecosystem."},{"type":"p","text":"Important platforms include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Siemens Teamcenter"},{"text":"PTC Windchill"}